<title>USA: Kansas City Southern CEO named chairman.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Southern CEO named chairman.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kansas City Southern Industries Inc said Thursday its board of directors elected chief executive officer Landon Rowland chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Rowland succeeds Paul Henson, who died April 12.</p>
<p>Shares of Kansas City Southern were up 1/8 at 51-5/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
